@startuml state_diagram

[*] --> PENDING

PENDING --> IN_PROGRESS : markInProgress()
IN_PROGRESS --> DONE : markDone()
DONE --> PENDING : reopen()

note right of PENDING
  isInProgress() returns False
  isPending() returns True
  isCompleted() returns False
end note

note right of IN_PROGRESS
  isInProgress() returns True
  isPending() returns False
  isCompleted() returns False
end note

note right of DONE
  isInProgress() returns False
  isPending() returns False
  isCompleted() returns True
end note

note bottom
  Invalid transitions are silently ignored.
  isOverdue() checks if due_date is in the past.
end note

@enduml